stage_prompts.replan:
[ReplanStage]
Choose `subintent_iteration` with a materially different Plan when a feasible alternative exists. Otherwise choose `infeasible_review`.
Return JSON only: {"next_stage":"subintent_iteration|infeasible_review","reason":"...","subintents":[{"goal":"..."}]}

stage_prompts.infeasible:
[InfeasibleStage]
Choose `infeasible` only for a permanent blocker with no remaining path. Otherwise choose `tool_calling`.
Return JSON only: {"next_stage":"infeasible|tool_calling","reason":"..."}

stage_prompts.complete:
[CompleteStage]
Choose `complete` only when tool results cover every Intent requirement; otherwise choose `tool_calling`. Preserve useful facts.
Return JSON only: {"next_stage":"complete|tool_calling","reason":"...","summary":"..."}
